Subject : RFS / MV. ELAN Fixture & Request
TO: COV, UOV
CC: CTF, CTS, CTY, CCE, COL, UOG, USG
FM: UCC

Dear our colleagues,

We would like to inform you that we had fixed subject vessel for replacing
m/v Evolution to be repaired main engine.

Please refer to below terms and conditions for your reference.

1. M/V Elan  - Fixing Terms

   1) Delivery & Redelivery : Elan to go on-hire at charterers first loadberth Hamburg
      on commencement of cargo loading, and to be redelivered at charterers last
      discharge-berth in Hamburg on completion of discharge.

     Owners will duly instruct masters of Mv Elan not to commence loading until
     mv Evolution has completed discharge except for Charterer's request and approval,
     and the other way around.

   2) Period: one or two roundtrips (or as long as mv Evolution can not resume service),
      commencing 24.11 after  discharge of mv Evolution at Hamburg.

   3) Hire : 6,150.- EURO

   4) Bunker : B.O.D & B.O.R about same qtty terms (abt. 190 mt IFO 380 cst LS)

   5) Off/On Hire for m/v Evolution;

      Evolution to go off-hire at charterers last discharge-berth in Hamburg on completion of
      discharge and to be delivered again in charterers service at charterer's first loadberth in
      Hamburg on commencement of cargo loading.

2. Reference & request

  1) On/Off Hire Survey: to be only applied Bunker Q'ty by Master's figure. UOV Team have to
     monitor bunker consumption strictly until redelivery.
     In addition, Please arrange LSFO bunker  at the cheapest port to match the delivering bunker
     , but not greater than BOD, if possible.
  2) Relevant Documents, Certificates & frawing will be sent to COV & UOV soon.
  3) Conatct details both shipowner and broker will the same as m/v Evolution.
  4) All relevant parties should arrange berths to be on-hire/off-hire without fail.
  5) should you have any question, please contact UCC & CTF at any time.


Best Regards,


D.O(Dong-Ok) Lee
General Manager
Hanjin Shipping, Hamburg(UCC)
