<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">FM: UCC</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">Dear our colleagues,</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">We would like to inform you that&nbsp;we had fixed subject vessel for replacing</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">m/v Evolution to be repaired main&nbsp;engine.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">Please refer to below terms and conditions for your reference.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">1. M/V Elan&nbsp;&nbsp;- Fixing Terms</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) Delivery &amp; Redelivery&nbsp;:&nbsp;Elan to go on-hire&nbsp;at charterers first&nbsp;loadberth Hamburg</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;on commencement&nbsp;of cargo loading, and to be redelivered at charterers last</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;discharge-berth in Hamburg on completion of discharge.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Owners will duly instruct masters of Mv Elan not&nbsp;to commence loading&nbsp;until<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;mv Evolution has completed discharge except for Charterer's request and approval,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;and the other way around. <o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) Period:&nbsp;one or two roundtrips (or as long&nbsp;as&nbsp;mv Evolution can not resume service),</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; commencing 24.11 after&nbsp; discharge of mv&nbsp;Evolution at Hamburg.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp; &nbsp;3) Hire : 6,150.- EURO</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) Bunker : B.O.D &amp; B.O.R about same qtty terms (abt. 190 mt IFO 380 cst LS)</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp; 5) Off/On Hire for m/v Evolution;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Evolution to go off-hire at charterers last discharge-berth in Hamburg on completion of</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;discharge and to be delivered again in charterers service&nbsp;at charterer's first loadberth in</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hamburg on commencement of cargo loading.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">2. Reference &amp; request<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp; 1) On/Off Hire Survey: to be only applied Bunker Q'ty by Master's figure.&nbsp;UOV&nbsp;Team have to<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; monitor bunker consumption strictly until redelivery.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In addition, Please arrange LSFO bunker&nbsp; at the cheapest port to match the delivering&nbsp;bunker<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;, but not greater than BOD, if possible.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp; 2) Relevant Documents, Certificates &amp; frawing will be sent to COV &amp; UOV soon.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp; 3) Conatct details both shipowner and broker will the same as m/v Evolution.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp; 4) All relevant parties should arrange berths&nbsp;to be on-hire/off-hire without fail.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;5) should you have any question, please contact UCC &amp; CTF&nbsp;at any time.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
